{"kind":"html","caption":"先从左向右扫描，把每个位置左侧元素的乘积写入 answer；再从右向左扫描，用一个滚动变量维护右侧乘积并乘入 answer。这样每个元素只访问两次，不需要除法，时间复杂度为 O(n)，除输出数组外只使用 O(1) 额外空间。示例中的 0 也无需特殊判断：只要按相同的前缀、后缀乘积流程计算即可。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>除了自身以外数组的乘积</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.badge{display:inline-block;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;color:#3794ff;font-size:10px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.status{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:8px}\n.phase{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.arrays{display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr;gap:4px 8px;align-items:center}\n.label{text-align:right;color:#3794ff;font-size:10px}\n.cells{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;position:relative;transition:.35s}\n.cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.done{border-color:#3794ff}\n.idx{position:absolute;bottom:1px;right:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font:9px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.formula{margin:8px 0;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;background:#252526;border-radius:4px;font:11px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#d4d4d4;min-height:32px}\n.formula b{color:#3794ff}\n.track{margin:8px 0;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.bar{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.zero{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>两次扫描拼左右乘积</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例 nums = <span class=\"mono\">[1, 2, 3, 4]</span></p>\n<span class=\"badge\">O(n) · 额外 O(1) · 无除法</span>\n<div class=\"status\"><span class=\"phase\" id=\"phase\"></span> <span id=\"message\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"arrays\">\n<div class=\"label\">nums</div><div class=\"cells\" id=\"nums\"></div>\n<div class=\"label\">answer</div><div class=\"cells\" id=\"answer\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"formula\" id=\"formula\"></div>\n<div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span>左扫：左侧乘积</span><span>右扫：× 右侧乘积</span></div>\n<div class=\"zero\"><strong>含 0：</strong> <span class=\"mono\">[-1,1,0,-3,3]→[0,0,9,0,0]</span></div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst nums=[1,2,3,4];\nconst frames=[\n{p:'准备：',m:'输出数组可直接充当前缀乘积表；左侧空乘积记为 1。',a:['?','?','?','?'],i:-1,f:'left = 1'},\n{p:'从左向右：',m:'位置 0 左边没有元素。',a:[1,'?','?','?'],i:0,f:'answer[0] = 1；left = 1 × 1 = 1'},\n{p:'从左向右：',m:'位置 1 左侧只有 1。',a:[1,1,'?','?'],i:1,f:'answer[1] = 1；left = 1 × 2 = 2'},\n{p:'从左向右：',m:'位置 2 左侧乘积为 1×2。',a:[1,1,2,'?'],i:2,f:'answer[2] = 2；left = 2 × 3 = 6'},\n{p:'从左向右：',m:'位置 3 左侧乘积为 1×2×3。',a:[1,1,2,6],i:3,f:'answer[3] = 6；left = 6 × 4 = 24'},\n{p:'转向：',m:'从最右端开始，右侧空乘积记为 1。',a:[1,1,2,6],i:-1,f:'right = 1'},\n{p:'从右向左：',m:'位置 3 乘上右侧空乘积。',a:[1,1,2,6],i:3,f:'answer[3] = 6 × 1 = 6；right = 1 × 4 = 4'},\n{p:'从右向左：',m:'位置 2 乘上右侧的 4。',a:[1,1,8,6],i:2,f:'answer[2] = 2 × 4 = 8；right = 4 × 3 = 12'},\n{p:'从右向左：',m:'位置 1 乘上右侧的 3×4。',a:[1,12,8,6],i:1,f:'answer[1] = 1 × 12 = 12；right = 12 × 2 = 24'},\n{p:'完成：',m:'位置 0 乘上右侧的 2×3×4，得到最终答案。',a:[24,12,8,6],i:0,f:'answer[0] = 1 × 24 = <b>24</b>　→　[24, 12, 8, 6]'}\n];\nfunction cells(el,values,active,done){el.innerHTML=values.map((v,i)=>`<div class=\"cell ${i===active?'active':''} ${done?'done':''}\"><span>${v}</span><span class=\"idx\">${i}</span></div>`).join('')}\nconst numsEl=document.getElementById('nums'),ansEl=document.getElementById('answer');cells(numsEl,nums,-1,false);let step=0;\nfunction draw(){const x=frames[step];document.getElementById('phase').textContent=x.p;document.getElementById('message').textContent=x.m;document.getElementById('formula').innerHTML=x.f;document.getElementById('bar').style.width=((step+1)/frames.length*100)+'%';cells(numsEl,nums,x.i,false);cells(ansEl,x.a,x.i,step===frames.length-1);step=(step+1)%frames.length}\ndraw();setInterval(draw,1500);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
